<title>USA: PCX to trade options on Hexcel Corp.</title>
<headline>PCX to trade options on Hexcel Corp.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Exchange (PCX) said Tuesday it will list options on Hexcel Corp on June 13.</p>
<p>The exchange said opening strike prices will be 15, 17-1/2 and 20 and initial expirations will be in July, August, October and January.</p>
<p>Position limits have been set at 4,500 contracts.</p>
<p>The options have been allocated to lead market makers Jeff Jones and Jeff Ng.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
